{"id":5227,"date":"2026-08-06T10:10:52","date_gmt":"2026-08-06T10:10:52","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/?p=5227"},"modified":"2026-08-08T07:28:02","modified_gmt":"2026-08-08T07:28:02","slug":"web-developer-job-description","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-job-description\/","title":{"rendered":"Web Developer Job Description: Roles &amp; Responsibilities"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Every business today depends on its website to reach its&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/target-audience\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">target audience<\/a>, which has made&nbsp;web development&nbsp;one of the&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/in-demanding-skills\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">most in-demand skill<\/a>&nbsp;sets in the tech industry. Behind every fast, functional, and&nbsp;well designed&nbsp;website is a developer who built and&nbsp;maintains&nbsp;it.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>That is why companies are hiring aggressively for these roles, and why a clear web&nbsp;developer&nbsp;job description matters for both sides. Recruiters need it to filter the right talent, and candidates need it to understand exactly what employers expect before they apply.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This 2026 guide covers everything you need: a ready to use job description template, responsibilities split by specialization and experience level, required skills and qualifications, salary ranges in India, practical tips to build a strong application, and answers to the most common questions.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who is a Web Developer?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>A web developer is a technical expert responsible for creating and&nbsp;maintaining&nbsp;websites and web applications accessed via the internet. They handle both server-side and front-end logic, implement the visual elements users see and interact with, and write clean code that keeps the platform running smoothly.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In simple terms, web developers build websites using code, design components, and layouts, while collaborating with project managers and designers to meet design specifications, timelines, and budgets. They also specialize in distributing network applications that run on protocols like HTTP from a web server to a browser.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>While the core web developer roles and responsibilities stay similar across the field, a junior web developer job description will look different from the three main specializations:&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Front-end web developer&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Back-end web developer&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Full-stack web developer&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Becoming a web developer may sound intriguing and exciting, but it demands a lot of effort, dedication, and commitment. So, join our online web development course to fulfill this dream, get trained by industry leaders, and begin your career confidently.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Web Developer Job Description Template (Ready to Use)<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>If you are a recruiter or hiring manager, you can copy the web development job description template given below and edit it as per your company, project, and hiring requirements.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Job Title:<\/strong>&nbsp;Web Developer&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Location:<\/strong>&nbsp;[City \/ Remote \/ Hybrid]&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Employment Type:<\/strong>&nbsp;[Full-time \/ Contract \/ Internship]&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Experience Required:<\/strong>&nbsp;[0 to 2 years \/ 2 to 5 years \/ 5+ years]&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Reports To:<\/strong>&nbsp;[Engineering Manager \/ Tech Lead \/ Project Manager]&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We are looking for a skilled web developer to build, test, and&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;responsive websites and web applications. The selected candidate will work closely with designers, product managers, and QA engineers to convert requirements into functional, secure, and high-performing web products.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Key Responsibilities<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Design, build, and&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;websites and web applications using modern frameworks and libraries.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Write clean, reusable, and well-documented code following current web development standards.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Convert UI and UX wireframes into functional interfaces that work across browsers and devices.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Build and integrate APIs and third-party services to support application features.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Manage databases, write optimized queries, and ensure data security and integrity.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Test, debug, and troubleshoot issues to&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;application stability.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Optimize&nbsp;applications for speed, scalability, and search engine visibility.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Maintain&nbsp;version control using Git and&nbsp;participate&nbsp;in code reviews.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Monitor website performance and implement regular updates and fixes.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Required Skills and Qualifications<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Bachelor&#8217;s degree in Computer Science, IT, or a related field, or equivalent practical experience.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strong command over <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">HTML<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/css\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">CSS<\/a>, and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/javascript\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">JavaScript<\/a>.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hands-on experience with at least one front-end framework, such as React, Angular, or Vue.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Working knowledge of a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/backend-languages\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">back-end language<\/a>, such as Node.js, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/python\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Python<\/a>, PHP, or <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Java<\/a>.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Experience with relational or NoSQL databases, such as MySQL, PostgreSQL, or MongoDB.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Familiarity with REST APIs, Git, and deployment workflows.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Good problem-solving, communication, and collaboration skills.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Preferred Qualifications<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Experience with cloud platforms, such as AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Understanding of&nbsp;CI and CD pipelines, containerization, and testing frameworks.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Exposure to&nbsp;performance optimization, accessibility standards, and web security practices.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>A portfolio of live projects or an active GitHub profile.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What We Offer<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>[Salary range]&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>[Benefits, learning budget, flexible hours, and other&nbsp;perks]<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3 class=\"mb-4\">Recommended Professional <\/br> Certificates<\/h3>\n\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel courseOwl\">\n\n                \n                    \n                    <div class=\"course-card card-r rounded-4\">\n\n                        <!-- \u2705 SINGLE MEDIA DIV (FIXED) -->\n         