applications, optimizing performance, and\u00a0maintaining\u00a0and updating live websites.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-job-description\/#faq-question-1786008306963\",\"position\":3,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-job-description\/#faq-question-1786008306963\",\"name\":\"3. What is the difference between front-end, back-end, and full-stack developers?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Front-end developers handle everything users see and interact\u00a0with,\u00a0back-end developers handle server logic, databases, and APIs, and full-stack developers work across both layers and can deliver a complete feature end to end.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-job-description\/#faq-question-1786008321507\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-job-description\/#faq-question-1786008321507\",\"name\":\"4. What qualifications do I need to become a web developer?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Most companies prefer a\u00a0bachelor's degree in Computer Science\u00a0or IT, but it is not mandatory. A strong grasp of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, a framework, a back-end language, and a solid project portfolio can help you enter the field through a certification course or bootcamp.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-job-description\/#faq-question-1786008336954\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-job-description\/#faq-question-1786008336954\",\"name\":\"5. How much does a web developer earn in India?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Freshers typically earn between 2.5 LPA and 4.5\u00a0LPA,\u00a0mid-level developers earn between 7 LPA and 12 LPA, and senior developers can earn 20 LPA or more depending on their stack, city, and company.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-job-description\/#faq-question-1786008349337\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-job-description\/#faq-question-1786008349337\",\"name\":\"6. Which programming languages should a web developer learn in 2026?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"JavaScript and TypeScript remain essential. On the back end, Node.js, Python, PHP, and Java continue to dominate hiring. Familiarity with SQL and at least one cloud platform is also expected in most job postings.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-job-description\/#faq-question-1786008361979\",\"position\":7,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-job-description\/#faq-question-1786008361979\",\"name\":\"7. Is web development a good career in 2026?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Businesses across every sector depend on web platforms, which keeps demand steady. Developers who combine core fundamentals with modern frameworks, cloud skills, and an understanding of performance and security continue to see strong opportunities.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-job-description\/#faq-question-1786008375509\",\"position\":8,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-job-description\/#faq-question-1786008375509\",\"name\":\"8. Do web developers need to know\u00a0design?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"They do not need to be de